{"UUID":"63550989-f035-4dc6-a8f6-c6f5c8482c33","DebugName":"Adagio_Salvage_Nyx_Intro","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Career","MissionType":{"UUID":"655cbe6e-19df-4757-8a05-a4cbd2bae78f","Name":"Salvage"},"MissionGiver":"Adagio Holdings","Title":"Adagio Holdings in Need of Salvagers","TitleKey":"Adagio_Industrial_Salvage_Universal_Intro_Title_001","Description":"Adagio Holdings\nA Proud Equal Opportunity Employer\n\n> About us <\nAs the leading procurer and distributor of salvage rights, Adagio Holdings are now looking to expand into the acquisition and distribution of salvageable materials to both small and large-scale businesses.\n\n> About the job <\nAs a part of this initiative, we need keen-eyed contractors capable of identifying salvageable materials, efficiently stripping them, and delivering the Recycle Material Composite (RMC) and salvaged components to us.\n\nThis introductory contract will require you to head to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> and strip an abandoned ship approved for salvage.\n\nOnce you've gathered the RMC, you'll deliver it to the freight elevator located at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>.\n\n> Requirements <\n     - Any class/size of salvage ship\n\nFor advice on salvaging, consult <EM4>A Salvager's Guide to Material Collection</EM4> in your mobiGlas journal.\n\n> Disclaimer <\nContractors are responsible for ensuring that they are collecting materials from vehicles that are considered fair salvage under the pursuant UEE laws. Adagio Holdings is in no way liable for any crimes or misdemeanors committed by contractors and will offer no compensation or reparation for any persons affected by these actions.","DescriptionKey":"Adagio_Industrial_Salvage_Universal_Intro_Desc_001","DisplayDescription":"Adagio Holdings\nA Proud Equal Opportunity Employer\n\n> About us <\nAs the leading procurer and distributor of salvage rights, Adagio Holdings are now looking to expand into the acquisition and distribution of salvageable materials to both small and large-scale businesses.\n\n> About the job <\nAs a part of this initiative, we need keen-eyed contractors capable of identifying salvageable materials, efficiently stripping them, and delivering the Recycle Material Composite (RMC) and salvaged components to us.\n\nThis introductory contract will require you to head to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> and strip an abandoned ship approved for salvage.\n\nOnce you've gathered the RMC, you'll deliver it to the freight elevator located at <EM4>Levski</EM4>.\n\n> Requirements <\n     - Any class/size of salvage ship\n\nFor advice on salvaging, consult <EM4>A Salvager's Guide to Material Collection</EM4> in your mobiGlas journal.\n\n> Disclaimer <\nContractors are responsible for ensuring that they are collecting materials from vehicles that are considered fair salvage under the pursuant UEE laws. Adagio Holdings is in no way liable for any crimes or misdemeanors committed by contractors and will offer no compensation or reparation for any persons affected by these actions.","LocationPools":{"DropoffLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Destination","ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"e67960e9-c04f-429f-b94f-ea8fdb8ad1b7","LocationTemplateUUID":"e67960e9-c04f-429f-b94f-ea8fdb8ad1b7","Name":"Levski","StarmapUUID":"468d4102-a210-47b5-8bc3-084f791a173c"}]},"MissionLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Location","ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"a8f96e99-2482-4673-9395-d44d8525ee9a","LocationTemplateUUID":"a8f96e99-2482-4673-9395-d44d8525ee9a","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"27683e1d-5b07-4338-9168-d2c1b91293a2","LocationTemplateUUID":"27683e1d-5b07-4338-9168-d2c1b91293a2","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"907d4b3b-f4f6-4f29-9229-e2f8caf95729","LocationTemplateUUID":"907d4b3b-f4f6-4f29-9229-e2f8caf95729","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"392ba55f-77f4-4241-84e9-97d07bda6554","LocationTemplateUUID":"392ba55f-77f4-4241-84e9-97d07bda6554","Name":"Keeger Belt Wreck Site"},{"UUID":"a8bf3c91-7a06-4950-8216-9cd5b80c7a78","LocationTemplateUUID":"a8bf3c91-